● | Repayment of an aggregate of up to $900,000 in loans that may be made to us by our sponsor to cover offering-related and organizational expenses;

● | Payment to our sponsor of up to $10,000 per month for administrative and support services;

● | Payment of consulting, success or finder fees to our sponsor, officers, directors, initial shareholders or their affiliates in connection with the consummation of our initial business combination;

